<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 39.87 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 39.87 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 39.87 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 367.16 million on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
